 165 00471 0010 VCDOTS, VCPICH  / dot pitch, next is line pitch
 166 00472 7700 VCDPLN, 0-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH-VCPICH
 167 00473 7733 NPCSGN, -0045
